From 82c066e1008e3ae6c375d2a0a3ee2fb7b46bcb3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 10:07:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 567/638] aros: remove Developer:Debug file-logging diagnostics

Drop the 58 fopen("Developer:Debug/...") probe sites left from the
mojo name-6 / navigation-pipeline / frame-sink investigations. Every
mojo packet was scanned byte-by-byte for the target interface id on
each send and receive, and the browser opened and closed a log file per
navigation step; none of it is needed now that those bugs are fixed.
The ArosChannel packet sequence counters had no consumer other than
the removed gap log and go with it. Retirement tracking in aros_channel
and channel_aros is kept.
